<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" article-type="correction" xml:lang="EN"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">Diabetes Care</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type="hwp">diacare</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type="pmc">dcare</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type="publisher-id">Diabetes Care</journal-id><journal-title>Diabetes Care</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">0149-5992</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1935-5548</issn><publisher><publisher-name>American Diabetes Association</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2660446</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="publisher-id">er04a</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2337/dc09-er04a</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Errata</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Errata</article-title></title-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><month>4</month><year>2009</year></pub-date><volume>32</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage seq="b">754</fpage><lpage>754</lpage><copyright-statement>&#x000a9; 2009 by the American Diabetes Association.</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2009</copyright-year><self-uri xlink:title="pdf" xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="zdc00409000754a.pdf"/></article-meta></front><body><p><bold>American Diabetes Association: Summary of revisions for the 2009 Clinical Practice Recommendations. <italic>Diabetes Care</italic> 32 (Suppl. 1):<related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="32" page="S3" id="N0x2352750N0x204b860" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="19118287" ext-link-type="pubmed">S3&#x02013;S5</related-article>, 2009</bold></p><p>In the print version of the article listed above, the term &#x0201c;CHF&#x0201d; is defined as &#x0201c;coronary heart failure.&#x0201d; The term should be defined as &#x0201c;congestive heart failure&#x0201d; instead. The online version reflects these changes.</p></body></article>